EasyScript interactive shell. Type a sentence, like: say "hello"
End a line with ":" to start a block (an if, a loop, or a definition); a blank line ends it.
Lines with errors aren't kept. Type exit to leave.
>> ... ... ... ... ... ... >> >> $1,858.15
